{"id":"drana","name":"Drana","type":"character","aliases":["Drana of House Kalastria","Drana, bloodchief","the bloodchief","vampire queen"],"description":"Drana is the vampire bloodchief of the last refugees of Guul Draz, who leads her people against the Eldrazi.","pages":7,"first_seen":"2015-09-16","last_seen":"2016-02-24","description_citations":[],"bio":{"summary":{"text":"Drana is the vampire bloodchief of the last refugees of Guul Draz, who leads her people against the Eldrazi.","cites":["memories-blood-2015-09-16-r0","memories-blood-2015-09-16-r7"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=all%2C%20vampire%20and%20mortal,bowed%20with%20her%20passing.","https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=she%20and%20her%20remaining,ever%2Dgrowing%20hordes%20of%20Eldrazi."],"citations":[]},"bio":[{"text":"Drana drove Kalitas and his traitors from Malakir, and she leads the last refugees fleeing the Eldrazi across Guul Draz.","cites":["memories-blood-2015-09-16-r2","memories-blood-2015-09-16-e0"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=Drana%20struck%20back%2C%20retaking,away%20from%20the%20city.","https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=There%20in%20the%20midst,the%20enormous%20Eldrazi%20sire"],"citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Memories of Blood","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2015-09-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=There%20in%20the%20midst,the%20enormous%20Eldrazi%20sire","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Memories of Blood\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Sep 2015."}]},{"text":"She bored into an Eldrazi sire's heart and drank its energy, recovering memories of her origin as a creature of Ulamog, and she reasserted herself with 'I serve no one'.","cites":["memories-blood-2015-09-16-e7","memories-blood-2015-09-16-e8"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=I%20was%20no%20longer,consuming%20force%20named%20Ulamog.","https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=I%20serve%20no%20one%21%20I%20will%20be%20free%21"],"citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Memories of Blood","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2015-09-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=I%20was%20no%20longer,consuming%20force%20named%20Ulamog.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Memories of Blood\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Sep 2015."},{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Memories of Blood","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2015-09-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=I%20serve%20no%20one%21%20I%20will%20be%20free%21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Memories of Blood\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Sep 2015."}]},{"text":"She released the energy as a magenta sun that healed her army and destroyed the Eldrazi, then ordered her survivors to cross to Tazeem to Sea Gate.","cites":["memories-blood-2015-09-16-e9","memories-blood-2015-09-16-e10"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=I%20belong%20to%20no,they%20belong%20to%20me.","https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=%22Make%20preparations%20to%20cross,going%20to%20Sea%20Gate.%