"official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Memories of Blood","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2015-09-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=%22Welcome.%20They%20come%20to,We%20will%20be%20accommodating.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Memories of Blood\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Sep 2015."}},{"id":"memories-blood-2015-09-16-e2","summary":"Enkindi, sent by Gideon, invites Drana's army to join Gideon's stand at Sea Gate.","participants":["enkindi","drana","gideon-jura"],"location":"guul-draz","importance":"major","page":"stories/memories-blood-2015-09-16","order":83,"story_date":"2015-09-16","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":25,"quote":"\"Win. We can win. Many of you are still strong. We know what you can do in battle. Join us.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=%22Win.%20We%20can%20win.,in%20battle.%20Join%20us.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Memories of Blood","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2015-09-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=%22Win.%20We%20can%20win.,in%20battle.%20Join%20us.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Memories of Blood\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Sep 2015."}},{"id":"memories-blood-2015-09-16-e3","summary":"Drana shows Enkindi the Orphans' Brigade of children and proposes he fight with her first before she goes to Sea Gate.","participants":["drana","enkindi","melindra","the-orphans-brigade"],"location":"guul-draz","importance":"major","page":"stories/memories-blood-2015-09-16","order":83,"story_date"