op. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Sep 2015."}},{"id":"memories-blood-2015-09-16-e5","summary":"Drana orders the Orphans' Brigade toward the sire as bait; Enkindi calls her a monster but leads his kor at the sire.","participants":["drana","enkindi","kan","the-orphans-brigade"],"location":"guul-draz","importance":"major","page":"stories/memories-blood-2015-09-16","order":83,"story_date":"2015-09-16","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":59,"quote":"The children will serve as necessary bait to lure the sire where we need it to be.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=The%20children%20will%20serve,need%20it%20to%20be.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Memories of Blood","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2015-09-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=The%20children%20will%20serve,need%20it%20to%20be.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Memories of Blood\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Sep 2015."}},{"id":"memories-blood-2015-09-16-e7","summary":"Drana bores into the sire's heart and drinks its energy, recovering memories of her origin as a creature of Ulamog.","participants":["drana","the-eldrazi-sire","ulamog"],"location":"guul-draz","importance":"major","page":"stories/memories-blood-2015-09-16","order":83,"story_date":"2015-09-16","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":72,"quote":"I was no longer an extension of it, of the consuming force named Ulamog.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=I%20was%20no%20longer,consuming%20force%20named%20Ulamog.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Memories of Blood","series":"Magic S